.vscode
/.claude/

# Compiled binaries. `go build` inside a cmd/ module drops the executable next
# to its source, named after the module directory.
/cmd/dmostd/dmostd
/cmd/dmosh/dmosh

# Local Go workspace. Each module must resolve on its own (the Docker build and
# anyone cloning the repo see no go.work), so a workspace is a per-checkout
# convenience and never committed. Recreate with:
#   go work init . ./cmd/dmostd ./cmd/dmosh
/go.work
/go.work.sum

# Local long-horizon run memory; these files never enter commits or PRs.
/docs/prompt.md
/docs/plans.md
/docs/implement.md
/docs/documentation.md
/docs/p2p/prompt.md
/.dmost-local/
